ABCs of Death 2 is a 2014 American comedy horror anthology
film produced by Ant Timpson and Tim League.

10
00:47:13,333 --> 00:47:19,333
It contains 26 different shorts, each by different
directors spanning various countries.

11
00:51:56,666 --> 00:52:02,666
It is a sequel to The ABCs of Death (2012), and second
installment in the ABCs of Death film series.

12
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:46,000
Directors featured include Jim Hosking, Lancelot Oduwa Imasuen, the Soska sisters, Julian Barratt, Rodney Ascher,
Kristina Buožytė, Larry Fessenden, Navot Papushado, Aharon Keshales, Bill Plympton, and Vincenzo Natali.

13
01:01:23,333 --> 01:01:29,333
The film received a much more positive response than its predecessor.

14
01:06:06,666 --> 01:06:12,666
A second sequel titled ABCs of Death 3: Teach Harder was announced to
be in development during the post-credits title card.

15
01:10:50,000 --> 01:10:56,000
However, due to illegal pirating of the second film, the status
of the project has been left in development hell.

16
01:15:33,333 --> 01:15:39,333
Despite this, producers released what they categorized as a
spin-off, titled ABC's of Death 2½ in 2016.

17
01:20:16,666 --> 01:20:22,666
The tone is lighthearted and dark and thought_provoking.
